out.push(A('⚠ **Part 2 reviews are marked on the recommendation and on whether the writer has a standard; this class loses marks on the first and gains them on the second.** **The sample gives three named readers and three answers, which is the shape to teach** — **and the standard is quoted from the work, which is the move that makes a non-specialist review markable at all.** **The limit is declared once, in one sentence, and the examiner can see that it is once.** ⚠ **And note the last line of the third paragraph: a count, a page and an index.** **A review that says _confusing_ scores in band 3 and a review that says _fourteen times, defined nowhere, no index entry_ scores above it, on the same observation.**'));
