out.push(A('**B  Listening.**   **Task One:** **1** **D**   **2** **G**   **3** **E**   **4** **C**   **5** **A**   ·   **Task Two:** **6** **A**   **7** **E**   **8** **B**   **9** **D**   **10** **C**'));
out.push(A('⚠ **Part 4 is the part where a candidate who answers Task One well loses Task Two, because the two tasks are heard in one pass and the second needs the end of each extract.** **Say that before the first listening and have the room mark Task One on the first hearing and Task Two on the second.** **At 6 the answer is in Speaker 1\'s last sentence** — _the only new thing in it was that I had put a person\'s post in a sentence_ — **and candidates who choose E have heard his eleven minutes and answered with a figure.** ⚠ **At 7 accept only E**: Speaker 2\'s ground is a count across four rounds, **and F is there because the room expects a threshold and she names none.** **At 8 the key is the handed-over test and not the four of eleven; at 9 it is the book\'s own first page and not the figure she could not place.** **Task One has three unused letters and Task Two has three** — **and a candidate who uses a letter twice has made an arithmetical error and should be shown it rather than told the answer.**'));
